<!doctype html>
<!--
  Parked under the ".off" name so it's harmless while sitting in the deployed public/ dir.
  deploy.sh renames it to maintenance.html to activate maintenance mode and back to this name
  to deactivate -- see DEPLOY.md and public/.htaccess. The content itself never changes between
  deploys, only the filename does.

  Deliberately self-contained: inline CSS, inline SVG-free wordmark markup, no external font or
  asset requests. This page must keep working even while the rest of the app is mid-deploy and
  potentially in a half-updated, broken state, so it cannot depend on anything else in the repo.
-->
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Wartungsarbeiten – Velofreundliches Wetzikon</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #f4f3ef;
    font-family: 'Roboto', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #000000;
  }
  .card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e8e6e0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 48px 32px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .logo__bar {
    width: 6px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 1px;
    background: #dc3406;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .logo__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .logo__top {
    font-family: 'Jost', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .logo__bottom {
    font-family: 'Jost', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-family: 'Jost', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #5e5e5a;
  }
  p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="logo" role="img" aria-label="Velofreundliches Wetzikon">
      <span class="logo__bar"></span>
      <span class="logo__text">
        <span class="logo__top">velofreundliches</span>
        <span class="logo__bottom">WETZIKON</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    <h1>Wartungsarbeiten</h1>
    <p>Wir aktualisieren gerade das Admin-Backend und sind in Kürze wieder da.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
